<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Reno</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Reno, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value for the area's growing new construction to handleless German luxury for high-end Tahoe homes — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. We offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win Reno–Tahoe projects.</p>

