<h2 id="reno-market-opportunity">The Reno Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>From Midtown and Old Southwest Reno to Somersett, ArrowCreek, and the Lake Tahoe basin, Reno kitchens blend contemporary design with mountain-modern warmth. Demand reflects the area's growth and Tahoe influence — contemporary styling with warm natural materials, two-tone schemes, and clean lines. Transplant demand from California has pushed interest in <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> construction and handleless fronts, while the Lake Tahoe market layers in mountain-modern warmth with <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh's</a> stain program — a strong, growing market for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Reno dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

